OL,3,AGrand Theft Auto 6 is a masterpiece,
OL,4,Asay critics
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter 13 years of waiting,
OL,7,Frecord-breaking trailers and lengthy
OL,8,Fdelays, critics have given their answer
OL,9,Fto one of the year's biggest questions.
OL,11,FDoes Grand Theft Auto 6, surely the
OL,12,Fmost anticipated game of all time, live
OL,13,Fup to the hype?
OL,15,FAccording to the first reviews, it's a
OL,16,Fresounding yes.
OL,18,FMetacritic, which aggregates reviews
OL,19,Ffrom critics, averages it at 99 out of
OL,20,F100 - tying with Nintendo's The Legend
OL,21,Fof Zelda: Ocarina of Time, which has
OL,22,Fheld the record since 1998.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
