OL,3,ASecurity flaw found in Java, world's
OL,4,Athird-largest programming language
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is meant to make the IT world more
OL,7,Fsecure by managing your memory online,
OL,8,Fsaid computer scientist Professor Toby
OL,9,FWalsh, which is why "this is such an
OL,10,Funlikely and serious flaw".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/18
