OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHarry Styles, Cher, Sam Fender and
OL,4,ABillie Eilish to headline Glastonbury
OL,5,A2027
OL,6,
OL,7,FOther acts on the line-up include
OL,8,FSombr, Sienna Spiro, Lily Allen, The
OL,9,FStreets, Chase & Status, Kacey
OL,10,FMusgraves, Primal Scream and breakout
OL,11,Fpop star Adela.
OL,13,FTickets for the festival sold out in
OL,14,Fjust 42 minutes last month, with demand
OL,15,Fparticularly high after the event took
OL,16,Fa year off in 2026.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
