OL,3,AMinister criticises media for
OL,4,A'amplifying' Russell Brand's prison
OL,5,Amessage
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour's deputy leader Lucy Powell has
OL,8,Fcriticised media organisations for
OL,9,Fbroadcasting a message from the wife of
OL,10,Fjailed rapist Russell Brand on his
OL,11,Fbehalf.
OL,13,FLaura Brand read out the message on the
OL,14,Fdisgraced comedian's YouTube channel on
OL,15,FSunday, in which he said he was not
OL,16,Fguilty of the offences for which he is
OL,17,Fserving a 10-and-a-half year prison
OL,18,Fsentence.
OL,20,FThe message has prompted an official
OL,21,Finvestigation into whether Brand broke
OL,22,Fprison rules.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
